#: src/Plugin.php:82
msgid "While Deployment Guard is active, it keeps a short local log of who enabled or disabled it, when scheduled freezes were changed, and which logged-in users attempted to make changes that were blocked. Each entry stores a user ID, a timestamp, and a short description of what was attempted; it never stores page content, form data, or IP addresses. This log stays in your site's own database, is never transmitted anywhere, and is limited to a fixed number of entries."
msgstr ""
